<title>USA: Alyn sees significant revenues in late '97.</title>
<headline>Alyn sees significant revenues in late '97.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alyn Corp said its new production facility in Irvine, Calif is on schedule to open in January.</p>
<p>Along with the continued expansion of its customer base, the company is on track for &quot;significant revenues&quot; in the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>Alyn makes a variety of products based on its patented metal matrix composite material.</p>
